\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Real platform screens from the six-hospital case study.} (a) The study protocol readiness view immediately after intake, showing the activation gate blocked with the specific unresolved items named (Population, Eligibility criteria, Analysis plan, and two more: participant sites and the ethics decision). (b) The sites-and-data view after Task 2, listing all six eICU-derived hospital sites with readiness passed. (c) The requirements chat window mid-conversation: 8 of 29 requirements answered against the real study (checks below), the assistant now asking about R09. All three screens are captured live from the deployed platform, not mocked.}}{8}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:case_study_gates}{{5}{8}{\textbf {Real platform screens from the six-hospital case study.} (a) The study protocol readiness view immediately after intake, showing the activation gate blocked with the specific unresolved items named (Population, Eligibility criteria, Analysis plan, and two more: participant sites and the ethics decision). (b) The sites-and-data view after Task 2, listing all six eICU-derived hospital sites with readiness passed. (c) The requirements chat window mid-conversation: 8 of 29 requirements answered against the real study (checks below), the assistant now asking about R09. All three screens are captured live from the deployed platform, not mocked}{figure.caption.6}{}}
